    "SteamDB is a hobby project and is not affiliated with Valve or Steam. All times on the site are UTC.": "SteamDB 是一个业余项目，与 Valve 或 Steam 无关。网站上的所有时间均为 UTC。",
    "We update data and charts for the current top 800 games every 5 minutes, and the rest every 10 minutes.": "我们每 5 分钟更新当前前 800 名游戏的数据和图表，其余每 10 分钟更新。",
    "SteamDB is a purely informational website, it does not provide any downloads, and does not solicit piracy.": "SteamDB 是一个纯信息网站，不提供任何下载，也不鼓励盗版。",
    "We track every new build on Steam, and try connect these builds to announcements by the game developers in their hub.": "我们追踪 Steam 上的每个新构建，并尝试将这些构建与开发者在游戏中心发布的公告关联起来。",
    "Due to a Steam change in June 2020, packages do not return any information until it is available in the store or owned.": "由于 2020 年 6 月的 Steam 变更，组合包在商店上架或被拥有前不会返回任何信息。",
    "Steam and the Steam logo are trademarks of Valve Corporation. All other trademarks are property of their respective owners.": "Steam 和 Steam 标志是 Valve Corporation 的商标。所有其他商标归各自所有者所有。",
    "This page is generated dynamically and lists most free packages that can be activated if you own base game, including demos.": "此页面动态生成，列出大多数拥有基础游戏即可激活的免费组合包，包括试玩版。",
    "We can calculate account worth in all currencies supported by Steam. Our site has price history for all games in all currencies!": "我们可以用 Steam 支持的所有货币计算账户价值。我们的网站有所有游戏的所有货币价格历史！",
    "This app is not included in any package known to us. As packages now require tokens, SteamDB needs a token to access package info.": "此应用不在我们已知的任何组合包中。由于组合包现在需要令牌，SteamDB 需要一个令牌来访问组合包信息。",
    "Deleted bundles, bundles with no price in your currency, and bundles with no base discount are hidden from this page. You can use search in the navbar.": "已删除的捆绑包、无你所在货币价格的捆绑包以及无基础折扣的捆绑包会从此页面隐藏。你可以使用导航栏中的搜索。",
    "In short, no. We believe if you need to get Steam data, you can get it from Steam directly using their WebAPI or using libraries like SteamKit (see above).": "简而言之，不行。我们相信如果你需要 Steam 数据，可以直接使用 Steam 的 WebAPI 或 SteamKit 等库获取（见上文）。",
    "This page will calculate the approximate value of your Steam account by looking up your games on your Steam community profile, using the current prices for each game on the Steam store.": "此页面将根据你的 Steam 社区个人资料中的游戏，使用 Steam 商店中每款游戏的当前价格，计算你 Steam 账户的近似价值。",
    "SteamDB is a community website and we do not make money, and maintaining the site is already enough work for us. Creating a good API is a lot of work and a big vector for abuse which we are not equipped to deal with.": "SteamDB 是一个社区网站，我们不赚钱，维护网站已经够辛苦了。制作一个好的 API 需要大量工作，而且是一个很大的滥用入口，我们不具备处理能力。",
    "Users claiming to be a Valve employee or Steam moderator, accounts asking to verify your items, and users who send you a message which insist you need to trade your items to them for investigation or security reasons should immediately be reported for trade scams.": "声称是 Valve 员工或 Steam 版主的用户、要求验证你物品的账户，以及坚持要你为调查或安全原因将物品交易给他们的用户，应立即举报为交易诈骗。"
  },
